WEBVTT

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:07.480
What? You're leaving the club, Senpai?

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.640
Yeah. I have entrance exams coming up,

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.230
and I can't study when I'm 
busy with club stuff.

00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:15.570
Oh... Th-That's true.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:17.520
It was great to be in the club with you!

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:19.210
Good luck on your exams!

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:20.760
Thanks!

00:00:23.490 --> 00:00:24.840
Akane!

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:28.750
I returned the club room key. 
Wanna head home together?

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.510
Yeah, sure.

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:34.580
Wait, don't you take the bus? 
I take the train.

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:36.710
Yeah, so we can just walk to the bus stop.

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:42.570
The song we did today was kinda hard, huh?

00:00:42.570 --> 00:00:44.150
Yeah, really hard.

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:49.590
<i>Entrance exams...</i>

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:52.830
<i>With Konomi-senpai acting as my go-between,</i>

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:54.990
<i>I made some friends in the club,</i>

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:58.570
<i>and my flute playing 
improved a little, but...</i>

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:01.390
See ya!

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:02.590
See ya.

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:07.980
I wonder if Konomi-senpai's 
going to quit, too...

00:01:25.350 --> 00:01:32.020
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:43.050
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:43.050
<b>My Senpai Had Entrance Exams Coming Up</b>

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:53.920
Hey, it's Akane-chan!

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:56.890
Over here! Akane-chan!

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:00.540
Konomi-senpai? What are you doing out here?

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:02.820
<b>Goldfish Scooping</b>

00:03:01.230 --> 00:03:02.830
Oh, there's a festival...

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.780
Yep, a festival.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:08.790
I thought you left kind of abruptly 
after our club practice.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:10.800
Was it to come here?

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:15.710
Well, actually, I'm on my way 
over to Nacchan's house,

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:18.560
but I thought I should pick 
up a little gift here first.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:19.450
Oh...

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:23.060
Hey, since you're here, let's walk 
around the festival together.

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:25.660
Huh? Sure, that's fine,

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:27.680
but what are you going to buy as a gift?

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:30.710
Hmm, I'm not sure...

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:34.380
Maybe I'll get her a mask.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:38.100
Although these look more suited 
for Renge-chan than Nacchan...

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:39.590
For Renge-chan?

00:03:39.590 --> 00:03:42.910
I bet she'd love this robot-looking one.

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:45.860
So that's the sort of thing
that Renge-chan likes...

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:48.890
Excuse me! I'd like this mask, please.

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:50.090
Sure.

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:53.510
Oh, and give me one that'll look 
good on my friend here, too.

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:54.280
Huh?!

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:57.290
<b>Ekimae-sando</b>

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:02.000
Does it... look good on me?

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:06.460
I'm... sorry about this.

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:07.960
Why are you apologizing?

00:04:08.270 --> 00:04:13.070
I thought it'd be a good way to thank 
you for going gift-shopping with me...

00:04:13.070 --> 00:04:14.150
Ah...

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:16.940
<b>Candied Apples</b>

00:04:15.620 --> 00:04:18.480
That just leaves gifts for 
Nacchan and her sister.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.900
<b>Yakitori</b>

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:21.860
We could get food, but it would smell, 
and since we're taking the train...

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:21.860
<b>Yakisoba</b>

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:24.580
Oh, that's a good point.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:29.360
Is there anything we could win 
from a lottery or something?

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:32.280
What about that candy-cutting 
booth over there?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.250
<b>Candy-Cutting</b>

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:34.260
Oh, good idea!

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:38.120
I did these all the time as a 
kid, so I'm really good at it.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:39.790
Wanna do one, too?

00:04:39.790 --> 00:04:41.960
Okay, just a quick one, then.

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:45.920
You just carve it out like this...

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:06.380
<i>Should I ask her about the club?</i>

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.880
<i>I don't know how to approach it, though...</i>

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:15.590
Akane-chan, yours broke so fast.

00:05:15.590 --> 00:05:17.470
I was thinking about something else...

00:05:17.470 --> 00:05:23.140
Okay, then, you can just sit there 
and watch my carving skills.

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:25.380
If you take it nice and slow, like this...

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:43.580
Gosh, that sure was embarrassing.

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:46.230
Don't tell the gang back 
at the village, okay?

00:05:46.230 --> 00:05:49.330
I don't think it's really 
that embarrassing...

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:53.950
Okay, then, let's try 
the shooting game next.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:57.110
I've never done a shooting game before...

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:02.010
Actually, I haven't, either.

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:05.930
But this kind of thing is 
all about beginner's luck.

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:12.180
<b>Fukuwarai</b>

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:14.820
Oh, you hit it!

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:17.870
Wow! Beginner's luck really did kick in!

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:20.320
Okay, maybe I'll get it, too.

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:27.650
You nailed it, too, Akane-chan!

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:31.230
Konomi-senpai, let's try it 
one more time! One more!

00:06:31.230 --> 00:06:33.250
All right! I'm not gonna lose!

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.810
Aw, I missed.

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:40.960
I missed mine, too.

00:06:41.320 --> 00:06:44.400
Those first shots were 
the only ones we landed.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.130
Well, that's how it goes.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.550
I ended up just enjoying 
this festival myself.

00:06:55.800 --> 00:06:58.190
We got quite a few gifts, too.

00:06:58.190 --> 00:06:59.240
Yeah.

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:03.430
You probably need to be 
heading home now, huh?

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:05.520
Oh... Yeah.

00:07:15.490 --> 00:07:17.580
Um, Konomi-senpai!

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:20.080
What is it, Akane-chan?

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:25.790
Um, so...

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:29.160
You have entrance exams soon, don't you?

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.790
Yeah... I guess I do.

00:07:38.220 --> 00:07:43.960
When I first joined the club, 
I didn't have any friends there.

00:07:43.960 --> 00:07:48.380
I wasn't sure if I'd be able to stick with it.

00:07:48.740 --> 00:07:51.330
But thanks to you,

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:54.450
I made friends with Renge-chan 
and some girls in the club...

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:58.620
And I enjoy the flute so 
much more than before.

00:07:59.100 --> 00:08:00.190
So...

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:04.330
Thank you for everything 
you've done for me!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:06.160
Good luck on your exams!

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.310
Akane-chan...

00:08:11.080 --> 00:08:15.160
I already got into a local 
university on a recommendation,

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:17.300
so I'm staying in the club until graduation.

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:18.490
Huh?

00:08:22.510 --> 00:08:25.450
Oh, could you say that 
one thing again, though?

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:26.650
That made me happy.

00:08:26.950 --> 00:08:28.610
Never!

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:31.240
Oh, hey, want to go to Nacchan's with me?

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:33.570
N-N-No, thank you!

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:40.540
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:45.290
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.920
<b>Fukuwarai</b>

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.920
<b>Jagaruko
Salad flavor</b>

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:55.620
Which should I go for?

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:59.120
Whoa, that was good! One shot!

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:02.100
Thanks for the bath. It felt great.

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.610
You're staying over tonight, right?

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:07.910
Yeah, your mom told me I should.

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:10.060
Where do you want to sleep? 
I gotta get a futon.

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:12.800
Let's all three sleep in my room!

00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:14.560
That'll be more fun!

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:17.320
Okay, let's do that, then.

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:19.700
There, the futon's ready.

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.700
The one in the middle is yours, Konomi-chan.

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:24.950
Well, let's turn off the light and go to—

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:33.230
It's too early to go to bed, Nee-chan!

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:34.910
We gotta have a pillow fight first!

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:38.640
Ow! I wondered why you 
threw that out of nowhere!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:41.090
We're not playing a silly 
kids' game like that!

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:42.650
Stupid Natsumi!

00:09:44.630 --> 00:09:47.190
So she said as she threw 
a pillow right back!

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:51.920
All right! I'm gonna show 
you how I throw pillows!

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:54.730
Natsumi-chan Dynamite Pillow Attack!

00:09:55.950 --> 00:09:57.200
Ow!

00:09:57.430 --> 00:10:00.410
I hit my hand on the sliding 
screen! That hurt!

00:10:00.410 --> 00:10:03.420
Boy, that was a mistake...

00:10:06.650 --> 00:10:09.320
Why are you both staring like that?

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:12.970
You look like I broke the 
screen or... something...

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:22.070
It was not my fault.

00:10:22.070 --> 00:10:24.240
Please understand this.

00:10:24.240 --> 00:10:25.690
Uh, we were watching.

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:28.130
You pretty much ordered us to.

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:32.360
C-Crap, crap, crap! 
I put a hole in the screen!

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:34.400
Wh-What do I do?

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:37.630
If Mom finds out, I'm in serious trouble.

00:10:37.630 --> 00:10:39.990
Nee-chan... Nee-chan, take my place.

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:43.230
Take your place?! 
I had nothing to do with it!

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:46.990
Nacchan, let's just go to sleep now.

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:49.380
We should be well-rested for 
getting in trouble tomorrow.

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:51.620
You can't abandon me, too, Konomi-chan!

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:56.010
Abandon you? What can I 
even do about it, though?

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:59.490
I just need to find a way to buy time...

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:00.970
That's it!

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:03.300
I'll cover the hole with this.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.730
There! That should...

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:08.680
<b>Fukuwarai</b>

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:10.470
It's the Fukuwarai!

00:11:10.470 --> 00:11:13.430
W-Will this work? Will she 
believe it's a poster?

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:16.970
I don't think so. It's clearly not a poster.

00:11:16.970 --> 00:11:19.280
Okay, well, fortune comes 
to those who smile!

00:11:19.620 --> 00:11:22.900
Hey, if you're gonna put the 
face on, pay attention!

00:11:22.900 --> 00:11:24.520
The cat looks ridiculous!

00:11:24.520 --> 00:11:26.850
Well, anyway, I covered the hole.

00:11:26.850 --> 00:11:31.180
Now... I'll put something against the 
door so Mom can't suddenly come in!

00:11:31.180 --> 00:11:33.500
It should be around here...

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:35.700
Found it! The thing for the morning glories!

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:37.890
I'll just block the door with this.

00:11:38.230 --> 00:11:40.130
There. All set.

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:43.290
Won't that just make her suspicious?

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:47.770
If it does, we'll fix everything with some 
inspiring words of youth or adolescence!

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:50.620
Well, all the emergency 
measures are in place now.

00:11:50.620 --> 00:11:53.120
Konomi-chan, what should I do next?

00:11:53.120 --> 00:11:56.620
What do you mean? 
Shouldn't you just apologize?

00:11:59.280 --> 00:12:01.240
Wait, what? What is it?

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:03.530
The sound of the floor 
creaking in the distance...

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:07.450
There's no question! 
Mom is heading toward this room!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:09.240
I don't know how you can hear that...

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:13.210
Th-This is bad! 
I don't even have a plan yet!

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:16.540
<i>N-No, it'll be fine! I covered 
the hole with the Fukuwarai,</i>

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.420
<i>and I blocked the door to the room.</i>

00:12:18.420 --> 00:12:20.860
<i>Yes, the defensive measures are in place.</i>

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:22.980
Hey, you girls!

00:12:22.980 --> 00:12:26.020
<i>Whatever happens, I can't let 
Mom in the room right now!</i>

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:28.460
<i>I'm trusting you, morning glory thing!</i>

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:31.960
Hey! You're making too 
much noise late at night!

00:12:32.590 --> 00:12:35.430
<i>I'll never trust you again, 
morning glory thing.</i>

00:12:35.430 --> 00:12:37.400
Ah, greetings, Mother!

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:40.010
We were just about to go to sleep!

00:12:40.010 --> 00:12:43.390
Yeah, right. If I hadn't come in, 
you would've been up all night.

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:46.020
No! That is most certainly not the case!

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:47.870
We are currently racked with sleepiness!

00:12:48.120 --> 00:12:50.550
Why do I get the feeling 
you're acting weird?

00:12:50.550 --> 00:12:52.880
Wh-What's this?! You wound me!

00:12:52.880 --> 00:12:54.840
This is how I always act!

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:58.110
You didn't do something bad again, did you?

00:12:59.230 --> 00:13:02.030
Why in the world did you 
put up a Fukuwarai there?

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:04.540
Oh, um, no reason at all, really!

00:13:06.750 --> 00:13:10.520
Wait, Natsumi... Did you think you 
were the one who broke the screen?

00:13:10.830 --> 00:13:11.580
Huh?

00:13:15.800 --> 00:13:17.830
That happened earlier today

00:13:17.830 --> 00:13:22.310
when I was cleaning your room 
and bumped it with my elbow.

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:27.900
A hole of that size is easy enough 
to fix, so I just left it alone.

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:29.530
Sorry I didn't tell you.

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:33.360
Come to think of it, we watched 
Natsumi throw the pillow...

00:13:33.360 --> 00:13:38.500
But we didn't see whether the hole 
was there before that or not.

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:42.850
You mean... I didn't 
break the screen at all?

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:44.470
Looks that way.

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:49.110
All right!

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:51.250
Natsumi-chan wins the case!

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:55.690
See, Nee-chan? 
I told you it wasn't my fault!

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:57.890
I never lie, you know!

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:02.100
No, you totally said that to 
avoid getting in trouble.

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:04.150
Whew, I'm saved!

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:06.160
I wasn't sure what was gonna happen!

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:08.860
Well, now that my innocence has been proven,

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:12.020
I don't need this Fukuwarai anymore!

00:14:30.800 --> 00:14:33.240
Fortune doesn't come to those who smile?

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:36.470
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:40.480
<b>Nonstop</b>

00:14:50.910 --> 00:14:53.170
All right, let's take a little break.

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:54.580
Okay.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:56.700
Did you bring a change 
of clothes, Akane-chan?

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:58.290
I sure did.

00:14:58.730 --> 00:15:01.660
Are you staying overnight, Akane-chin?

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:04.380
Yeah. Like a training camp.

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:06.690
Oh, that sounds cool!

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:11.760
Konomi-chan, you spent the night at 
Nattsun's for moon-viewing day, didn't you?

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:13.230
That's right.

00:15:13.230 --> 00:15:16.720
We had fun, so I invited 
Akane-chan to stay this time.

00:15:16.720 --> 00:15:18.090
I see.

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:21.760
Wait here a sec. I'll get us some drinks.

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:23.240
Th-Thank you.

00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.780
What's wrong, Akane-chin?

00:15:32.780 --> 00:15:34.810
Huh? Wh-What do you mean?

00:15:34.810 --> 00:15:37.160
You were staring into space.

00:15:37.160 --> 00:15:39.610
Uh... Oh, just...

00:15:41.540 --> 00:15:44.410
Senpai's about to graduate,

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:47.630
so I was wondering how long 
I'd be able to visit here.

00:15:54.380 --> 00:15:56.380
Hi, Konomi-chan!

00:15:56.380 --> 00:15:57.880
Is Ren-chon here?

00:15:57.880 --> 00:16:01.320
We heard Ren-chan was at your house.

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:03.860
Wow, you're all together.

00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:07.780
Renge-chan, Akane-chan, and I were 
just doing a little flute practice.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:09.770
Hey, I know!

00:16:09.770 --> 00:16:13.160
What?! Perform in front 
of everyone by myself?!

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:16.950
I thought it'd be a great opportunity, 
since they're all here.

00:16:16.950 --> 00:16:18.990
Wha... uh...

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:20.130
I wanna hear your flute!

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:22.560
B-But you're right.

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:26.710
All this practicing was so I 
could play in front of people.

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:29.600
All right! I'll do it!

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:53.030
That sounded like a tea kettle!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:56.170
Wh-What's wrong, Akane-chan? Are you okay?

00:16:56.500 --> 00:17:00.740
Y-Yeah... Between my nerves and the 
heat, my head just went fuzzy...

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:04.500
Um... We can save this for another time.

00:17:04.730 --> 00:17:08.440
N-N-No! I'm gonna do it, Komari-chan!

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:12.980
Hey, I know. Since it's warm today, 
why not perform outside?

00:17:12.980 --> 00:17:15.730
You should be able to relax 
a little more that way.

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:18.460
Y-You're right! Let's do that!

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:41.490
How about right around here?

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.490
O-Okay!

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:03.610
Akane-chan, just do what 
you've always done.

00:19:58.010 --> 00:19:59.680
You did great today.

00:19:59.680 --> 00:20:02.050
What time are you leaving tomorrow?

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:04.910
Oh, I was thinking of 
leaving in the evening.

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:08.340
Okay. So we can practice 
a bit more tomorrow.

00:20:08.340 --> 00:20:10.030
I'm gonna turn off the light.

00:20:10.030 --> 00:20:11.110
Okay.

00:20:25.970 --> 00:20:27.970
Akane-chan, you awake?

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:32.530
What is it?

00:20:33.600 --> 00:20:37.090
I'm going to keep playing 
the flute in college,

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:39.440
so let's keep practicing together.

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:49.330
Okay!

00:20:49.330 --> 00:20:51.370
You scared me!

00:20:51.370 --> 00:20:52.980
Not so loud. It's nighttime, you know.

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:55.440
S-Sorry...

00:20:55.680 --> 00:20:58.930
Sorry for talking when you 
were about to fall asleep.

00:20:58.930 --> 00:21:01.140
N-No, it's all right!

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:04.860
Well, we have practice tomorrow, 
so we should sleep.

00:21:04.860 --> 00:21:06.600
R-Right!

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:08.060
Okay, goodnight.

00:21:08.060 --> 00:21:09.590
Goodnight.

00:21:13.490 --> 00:21:16.790
Konomi-chan, I came to practice with you.

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:19.750
Oh, Renge-chan. Come on in.

00:21:20.550 --> 00:21:23.580
Since Renge-chan's here, 
I'm going to get some drinks.

00:21:23.580 --> 00:21:24.650
Okay.

00:21:32.150 --> 00:21:35.860
Akane-chin, you seem happier 
than you were yesterday.

00:21:35.860 --> 00:21:37.770
Did something good happen?

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:44.570
Yeah, just a little.

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:48.880
Anyway, which song should we practice today?

00:21:48.880 --> 00:21:51.350
Well, I wanted to do the one from—

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:53.960
Renge-chan, I brought some juice.

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:55.620
Ooh! Juice!

00:22:00.630 --> 00:22:04.340
<b>Non Non Biyori</b>

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:13.060
<b>That's all for today</b>

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:32.910
E-Eek!

00:23:32.910 --> 00:23:35.450
A weasel got into the house!

00:23:34.690 --> 00:23:36.640
I just wore long johns on my head!

00:23:36.640 --> 00:23:39.120
I made a sweater for you, Senpai!

00:23:39.120 --> 00:23:41.500
Oh, so Komari's cooking?

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:43.250
You forgot to season it, 
and it just tasted burnt!

00:23:43.250 --> 00:23:44.920
It was flavorless burn-tin!

00:23:44.130 --> 00:23:46.520
All right! I'll put in a ton of sugar!

00:23:46.530 --> 00:23:50.530
<b>Next Time
Episode 9</b>

00:23:46.530 --> 00:23:50.530
<b>We Made Tasty Food</b>

00:23:50.530 --> 00:23:54.410
Photo: Zukki

